  "title": "Veal Marsala",
  "description": "In this veal Marsala recipe, veal cutlets are pounded thin, breaded and cooked in a skillet with butter, mushrooms and Marsala wine. Simple but elegant!",
  "authors": [
    "Christine"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-06-09T17:18:45-04:00",
